:"கடு","lemma":"கடு","gloss":"swift"}],"gloss":"swift"},{"surface":"மா","parts":[{"text":"மா","lemma":"மா","gloss":"horse"}],"gloss":"horses"},{"surface":"கடவுமதி","parts":[{"text":"கடவு","lemma":"கடவு","gloss":"drive"},{"text":"மதி","lemma":"மதி","gloss":"polite imperative suffix"}],"gloss":"please drive"},{"surface":"பாக","parts":[{"text":"பாக","lemma":"பாகன்","gloss":"O charioteer"}],"gloss":"O charioteer"},{"surface":"நெடு","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"நெடு","gloss":"deep/long"}],"gloss":"deep"},{"surface":"நீர்","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"water"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பொரு","parts":[{"text":"பொரு","lemma":"பொரு","gloss":"fight"}],"gloss":"fighting"},{"surface":"கயல்","parts":[{"text":"கயல்","lemma":"கயல்","gloss":"carp fish"}],"gloss":"carp fish"},{"surface":"முரணிய","parts":[{"text":"முரணிய","lemma":"முரணிய","gloss":"which rivalled"}],"gloss":"which rivalled","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உண்கண்","parts":[{"text":"உண்","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"consume"},{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"}],"gloss":"kohl-adorned eyes"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தெரி","parts":[{"text":"தெரி","lemma":"தெரி","gloss":"clear/chosen"}],"gloss":"clear"},{"surface":"தீம்","parts":[{"text":"தீம்","lemma":"தீமை","gloss":"sweet"}],"gloss":"sweet"},{"surface":"கிளவி","parts":[{"text":"கிளவி","lemma":"கிளவி","gloss":"speech/words"}],"gloss":"speech"},{"surface":"தெருமரல்","parts":[{"text":"தெருமரல்","lemma":"தெருமரல்","gloss":"distress/whirling of mind"}],"gloss":"distress"},{"surface":"உயவே","parts":[{"text":"உய்","lemma":"உய்","gloss":"to escape/be saved"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"so that"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"so that she is relieved"}]}],"literal":"Having drunk the water occurring in the gravelly hollows, along with its companion / the stag, the beautiful deer, leaps at the head of the path. / Before evening comes, with wind-like / movement, drive the swift horses, O charioteer! Deep water's / clashing kayal fish-rivalled kohl-adorned eyes / and clear sweet speech, so that her distress is relieved.","translation":"O charioteer! Drive the swift horses with the speed of the wind, before evening arrives—the hour when the beautiful stag, having drunk the water gathered in gravelly hollows, leaps along the path with its mate. Let us hasten, so that her distress may be relieved—she of the clear, sweet words and kohl-adorned eyes that rival clashing kayal fish in deep water.","modern":"பாகனே! பரல் கற்கள் நிறைந்த பள்ளங்களில் தேங்கிய நீரைப் பருகிவிட்டு, தன் துணையோடு ஆண் மான் பாதையின் தொடக்கத்தில் துள்ளி விளையாடும் மாலைக் காலம் வருவதற்கு முன்பாக, காற்றின் வேகத்தைக் கொண்ட உன்னுடைய வேகமான குதிரைகளைச் செலுத்துவாயாக! ஆழமான நீரில் ஒன்றோடொன்று போரிடும் கயல் மீன்களைப் போன்ற மை தீட்டிய கண்களையும், தெளிவான இனிய சொற்களையும் உடைய என் தலைவியின் மனத்துயரம் நீங்குமாறு விரைந்து செல்வாயாக!","explanation":"The hero is speaking to his charioteer as they return home after completing his mission. He has traveled through the arid desert (Pālai) and is eager to reach his beloved before evening falls, knowing that the onset of evening will intensify her grief of separation. He points out the stag and its mate happily leaping together after drinking water from the gravelly pits. This image of animal companionship contrasts with his beloved's lonely state and heightens his urgency. The poem transitions from the dry Pālai landscape to the Mullai landscape of patient waiting and return. Key words include 'மாலை வாரா வளவை' (before evening comes) and 'தெருமரல் உயவே' (so that her distress is relieved).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.2],[1.2,1.58],[1.58,2.0],[2.0,2.0],[2.0,2.15],[2.15,2.92],[3.23,4.0],[4.0,4.53],[4.79,5.05],[5.05,5.05],[5.05,5.57],[5.84,6.1],[6.1,7.3],[7.3,7.4],[7.4,8.1],[8.21,9.2],[9.2,9.7],[9.7,10.1],[10.1,11.03],[11.03,11.5],[11.73,11.97],[11.97,12.2]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.2],[1.2,1.48],[1.48,1.9],[2.06,2.7],[2.7,3.1],[3.18,3.61],[3.78,4.2],[4.2,5.3],[5.3,5.43],[5.43,5.47],[5.47,5.47],[5.47,5.5],[5.5,7.8],[7.8,8.0],[8.0,8.7],[8.81,9.8],[9.8,10.3],[10.3,10.63],[10.63,10.7],[10.7,12.1],[12.1,12.47],[12.47,13.0]]},"sync":[[["பரல்","gravel"],["அவல்","hollow"]],[["படு","occurring"],["நீர்","water"]],[["மாந்தி","having drunk"],["துணையோ","companion (with...)"]],[["துணையோ","companion (with...)"]],[["டிரலை",""]],[["நன்மா",""]],[["னெறிமுத",""]],[["லுகளும்",""]],[["மாலை","evening"]],[["வாரா","before coming"]],[["அளவை","at the time"],["கால்","wind-like"]],[["கால்","wind-like"],["இயல்","movement"]],[["கடு","swift"],["மா","horses"]],[["கடவுமதி","please drive"]],[["பாக","O charioteer"]],[["நெடு","deep"],["நீர்","water"]],[["பொரு","fighting"],["கயல்","carp fish"]],[["முரணிய","which rivalled"]],[["உண்கண்","kohl-adorned eyes"]],[["தெரி","clear"],["தீம்","sweet"]],[["கிளவி","speech"]],[["தெருமரல்","distress"]],[["தெருமரல்","distress"],["உயவே","so that she is relieved"]]]}